        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5115HN, Keyed Hanover Lever with Disk Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Contemporary Hanover Key in Lever with Disk Rose features an offset lever that adds a modern twist to the sleek leverset. It is a available in a huge selection of finishes. The Keyed Hanover Lever with Modern Disk Rosette is available in two functions: a keyed entry--where a key operates the latch from the exterior--and a dummy key in lever--which does not latch nor lock. The Hanover Keyed Entryset will fit doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-hanover-key-in-lever-with-disk-rose-emtek-s901hn\"><b>Stainless Steel Hanover Key in Lever with Disk Rose</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the Emtek Hanover Keyed Entry Lever with Round Disk Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Clearance: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-5115HN-specifciations.pdf?v=1704262351\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 5115HN Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. The lock is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, keys, door latch, and strike plate.\r\n<li><b>Dummy:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Hanover Key in Lever with Disk Rose",
                "description": "The Contemporary Hanover Key in Lever with Disk Rose features an offset lever that adds a modern twist to the sleek leverset. It is a available in a huge selection of finishes. The Keyed Hanover Lever with Modern Disk Rosette is available in two functions: a keyed entry--where a key operates the latch from the exterior--and a dummy key in lever--which does not latch nor lock. The Hanover Keyed Entryset will fit doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. \r\n",
